es.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#The_Desert&#39;s_Starless_Nights\" title=\"Named item sets\">The Desert's Starless Nights</a>:</b> 2 Pieces Equipped:<br />+2% Artifact bonus to Negative and Poison Spellcrit Chance<br />+10 Artifact bonus to Negative and Poison Spellpower<br />+5% Artifact bonus to Damage vs the Helpless</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#The_Desert&#39;s_Writhing_Storm\" title=\"Named item sets\">The Desert's Writhing Storm</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#The_Desert&#39;s_Writhing_Storm\" title=\"Named item sets\">The Desert's Writhing Storm</a>:</b> 2 Pieces Equipped:<br />+2% Artifact bonus to Electric Spellcrit Chance<br />+10 Artifact bonus to Electric Spellpower<br />+10 Artifact bonus to Magical Resistance Rating</span></span></li></ul></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Ring Boost</a> +1 or +3<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Ring Boost</a> +1 or +3:</b> +1 or +3 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Melee_Power\" title=\"Melee Power\">Melee</a>, <a href=\"/page/Ranged_Power\" title=\"Ranged Power\">Ranged</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Universal_Spell_Power\" title=\"Universal Spell Power\">Universal Spell Power</a>.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Mysterious_Ring.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Mysterious_Ring.png/420px-Mysterious_Ring.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"382\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Mysterious_Ring.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><a href=\"/page/Essence_Crafting\" title=\"Essence Crafting\">Essence Crafting</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>A featureless gold band that has some mysterious magical effect.<br /><br />This item may be used with Essence Crafting.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span></li>\n<li>Since <a href=\"/page/Update_55\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Update 55\">Update 55</a>, this ring has a Yellow augment slot, one <i>random</i> Menechtarun set bonus, and can be upgraded via <a href=\"/page/Essence_Crafting\" title=\"Essence Crafting\">Essence Crafting</a>. When disjuncted for crafting, this item loses any <a href=\"/page/Reaper_bonus\" title=\"Reaper bonus\">Reaper bonus</a> it possesses.</li>\n<li>There is no \"Epic\" version of this item. However, it can be Essence Crafted to any ML desired.</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817222926\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.097 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.140 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5456/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 36151/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 13411/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 32/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4051/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 13/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n111.23%  134.300     63 Template:IO\n100.00%  120.741      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  120.741      1 -total\n 97.69%  117.950      1 Template:Named_Jewelry\n 36.40%   43.944      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 35.64%   43.036      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 34.89%   42.124      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 34.10%   41.176      2 Template:InCategory\n 20.81%   25.123      9 Template:Popup\n 14.64%   17.682      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:11182-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817222926 and revision id 699547. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
